\title{pivotWBnorah: Reshape World Bank Indicator Data from Wide to Long Format}
\description{
World Bank indicator files store one column per year (for example X2000, X2001, ...). This package converts such a file into a long country-year data set with one row per country and year, ready to be merged with other country-year data. It was written for the CHL5233 armed conflict project, where the maternal, infant, neonatal and under-5 mortality files are each reshaped and then joined.
